course: dictionary
lesson: 4829
title: One word, two jobs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A husband is the man a person is married to. «Her husband brought her a cup of tea on Sunday morning.» The word tells you who he is to her, so it is a family word that you meet in everyday life and in stories.
explain: Check the words around husband to be sure of its meaning. Phrases like «husband and wife» and «her husband» show it is about marriage. «Ex-husband» adds the word ex, which means he was her husband once but is not now.
explain: Husband can also be a verb, but it is formal and old-fashioned. It means to use something carefully so it does not get wasted, as in «husband your energy» on a long run. When a word can be a noun or a verb, read the whole sentence to find which job it is doing.
fact: A husband is a man who is married to someone.
fact: A widow is a woman whose husband has died, and a widower is a man whose wife has died.
fact: «Other half» is an everyday UK way to mean a husband, wife or partner.
fact: «Companion» means a long-term partner who is not a husband or wife, and it is old-fashioned.
fact: As a verb, «husband» means to use something carefully so that it is not wasted.
exercise: «A widow is a woman whose husband has died.» In this sentence, what is a widow? | A woman who has never married | A man who lives alone | *A woman whose husband has died | A man whose wife has died
exercise: «Her husband and her children waited at the station.» Who is her husband? | Her boss at work | Her brother | *The man she is married to | Her son
exercise: «Tom had to husband his energy for the last mile.» What does husband mean here? | *To use carefully so it is not wasted | To shout loudly | To marry someone | To carry heavy bags
test: «Her ex-husband no longer lives with her.» What does ex-husband mean? | Her brother | Her new husband | A man who lives with her | *A man who was once her husband but is not now
test: Which word means a long-term partner who is not a husband or wife? | Widower | Widow | *Companion | Husband
exam: Which sentence uses husband as a verb? | «Her husband is a doctor.» | *«She had to husband the last of the water across the desert.» | «Husband and wife walked home together.» | «A widow lost her husband last year.»
